  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Humanitarian Assistance to Refugees in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the context of the Refugee Response in Armenia, following the arrival of more than 100,000 refugees in September/October 2023, IOM will address the most pressing humanitarian needs, focusing on the most vulnerable, through the delivery of primary health care and mental health and psychosocial support services, as well as shelter solutions and shelter repairs of existing collective shelters set-up by the government to accommodate particularly vulnerable people, particularly in view of the approaching winter.</narrative>
  </description>
